{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-logbook#card-zh","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-logbook","commit":"c4ced44ab9babd920631939e23f7e4b614d7f5b6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-logbook（DSH 插件，适用于可运行插件命令的客户端）：让 DSH 插件通过聊天命令查看近期日志，并把日志实时输出到 stderr。它注册 /logs 命令并安装日志 exporter，将记录保存在有容量上限的内存环形缓冲区。主要功能包括按级别、logger 名称、文本和时间筛选日志，限制显示数量，配置 stderr 的默认及逐 logger 输出级别，并容忍输出错误。适合需要在聊天中排查插件运行日志或在终端收集 stderr 的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key 或外部服务，可配置保留条数和输出级别。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:74-120","cordis.patch.yml:9-12"]}
{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-logbook#card-en","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-logbook","commit":"c4ced44ab9babd920631939e23f7e4b614d7f5b6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-logbook adds the /logs chat command and a stderr logger exporter. Filter recent records by level, logger name, text, or age, and limit results. A bounded in-memory ring keeps recent logs; stderr levels are configurable. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:74-120","cordis.patch.yml:9-12"]}
