{"unit_id":"d3vmeh__dsh-logbook#feature-1","repo":"d3vmeh/dsh-logbook","commit":"c4ced44ab9babd920631939e23f7e4b614d7f5b6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-logbook 的功能「日志查询」：用户在聊天中运行 /logs，可按级别、logger 名称、文本关键词和时间范围筛选记录，并用 --limit 控制显示条数；结果按记录顺序返回。 触发方式：logs-command。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-45","src/index.js:105-120"]}
